{"id":"staple/空气炸锅照烧鸡饭/空气炸锅照烧鸡饭","title":"空气炸锅照烧鸡饭","heading":"空气炸锅照烧鸡饭的做法","category":"staple","difficulty":4,"kcal":"1854 大卡","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Anduin2017/HowToCook/blob/5fb3140c20b2a713296696dc6fdd3b83ccc617a6/dishes/staple/%E7%A9%BA%E6%B0%94%E7%82%B8%E9%94%85%E7%85%A7%E7%83%A7%E9%B8%A1%E9%A5%AD/%E7%A9%BA%E6%B0%94%E7%82%B8%E9%94%85%E7%85%A7%E7%83%A7%E9%B8%A1%E9%A5%AD.md","html":"<div class=\"section-intro\"><h1>空气炸锅照烧鸡饭的做法</h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Anduin2017/HowToCook/5fb3140c20b2a713296696dc6fdd3b83ccc617a6/dishes/staple/%E7%A9%BA%E6%B0%94%E7%82%B8%E9%94%85%E7%85%A7%E7%83%A7%E9%B8%A1%E9%A5%AD/%E7%A9%BA%E6%B0%94%E7%82%B8%E9%94%85%E7%85%A7%E7%83%A7%E9%B8%A1%E9%A5%AD.jpg\" alt=\"空气炸锅照烧鸡饭成品\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\n<p>这道日式照烧风味的鸡肉饭，甜咸酱汁浓郁，表层烘烤得略微焦脆，内里软嫩多汁，搭配米饭非常下饭。鸡肉和鸡蛋提供丰富的优质蛋白，不过酱油和糖的用量较多，更适合偶尔改善口味。做法简单，只需混合原料交给空气炸锅，新手也能轻松搞定，从准备到出锅大约需要 1 小时。</p>\n</div><div class=\"cook-grid\"><div class=\"cook-side\"><section class=\"section-ingredients\"><h2>必备原料和工具</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>丽滋饼干(Ritz crackers)</li>\n<li>酱油</li>\n<li>糖（白沙糖）</li>\n</ul>\n</section><section class=\"section-calc\"><h2>计算</h2>\n<p>每次制作前需要确定计划做几份。一份正好够 1 个人吃。</p>\n<p>每份：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>鸡肉 900g</li>\n<li>酱油 100-125ml</li>\n<li>糖 60-65g</li>\n<li>白醋 30-35ml</li>\n<li>丽滋饼干（咸味曲奇可替代） 16 个(48g)</li>\n<li>鸡蛋 2 个</li>\n</ul>\n</section></div><section class=\"section-steps\"><h2>操作</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>将酱油、糖和醋混合在一起,搅匀料汁备用</li>\n<li>另一个碗中加入鸡肉、鸡蛋、1/2 料汁和压碎的丽滋饼干。搅拌均匀</li>\n<li>空气炸锅用箔纸碗铺底，加入肉饼混合物，将剩余的料汁均匀的倒在上面</li>\n<li><strong>350°F(177°C)</strong> 炸<strong>40 分钟</strong>。最好在米饭上食用</li>\n<li>在外观<em>呈金黄酥脆</em>后出锅，切块盛盘</li>\n</ol>\n</section></div><section class=\"section-extra\"><h2>附加内容</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>米饭的做法参考<a href=\"https://cook.aiursoft.com/dishes/staple/%E7%B1%B3%E9%A5%AD/%E7%94%B5%E9%A5%AD%E7%85%B2%E8%92%B8%E7%B1%B3%E9%A5%AD/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">电饭煲蒸米饭</a>或<a href=\"https://cook.aiursoft.com/dishes/staple/%E7%B1%B3%E9%A5%AD/%E7%85%AE%E9%94%85%E8%92%B8%E7%B1%B3%E9%A5%AD/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">煮锅蒸米饭</a></li>\n<li>操作时，需要注意温度以免烫伤。</li>\n<li>参考资料：<a href=\"https://cookpad.com/eng/recipes/16276348\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">库克美食教程:Air fryer Teriyaki Chicken Meatloaf</a></li>\n</ul>\n</section>"}